1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,300
M: I am expected to give a speech in front of all the directors in half an hour.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,920
I'd better go upstairs to the conference room and get all the necessary equipment ready.

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,440
W: Do you need any help?

4
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:14,220
I could probably give you a hand setting up the projector or something.

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,040
M: That's very nice of you, Jan.

6
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,140
In fact, I could use more copies of these figures.

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:19,980
Do you mind?

8
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,740
W: No, not at all.

9
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,395
I will get them ready and bring them up to the conference room right away.
